    "Condition : 1 - The proposed rear dormer, because its size, design and appearance would dominate the roof slope, and be at odds with the style and character of the subject dwelling, as well as being out of character with the prevailing pattern of the development in the area. The proposed single storey side extension would be an intrusive addition which would have a negative effect on the visual amenity of the locality. The proposal is considered to adversely affect the amenity of adjoining neighbours and be contrary to policies ENV.1.1, ENV 1.2 and H.3.4 of the Council's Unitary Development Plan."
